    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to bring No. 35 Academy Square, Navan to the market. This two bedroom apartment is located in the much sought after Academy Square development which is situated off the R147 / Dublin Road and just minutes away from the M3 Motorway. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of entrance hall, living area, kitchen/dining area, two double bedrooms with a master ensuite and main bathroom. The apartment has also provides a balcony which overlooks the Boyne River and includes secure designated underground car parking. The apartment is presented in good condition throughout and provides ample living space with the entire extending to 68sqm in size.\r\n\r\nAcademy Square is a desirable development located within walking distance of Navan Town Centre, as well as amenities including national schools, restaurants, sporting clubs, public transport and Navan Shopping Centre. The property is located 25 minutes from Blanchardstown, 40 minutes from Dublin City Centre and 40 minutes from Dublin Airport. The property is also ideally located beside mulitiple bus stops inlcuding the 109 and the NX which are both direct bus routes into Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nViewings by appointment"
      },
